WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.330 line:88%
You want to help.

2
00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.150 line:88%
But where do you start?

3
00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:08.237 line:88%
Introducing People for People,

4
00:00:08.287 --> 00:00:12.277 line:88%
the app that connects your desire to help
with real opportunities.

5
00:00:15.087 --> 00:00:17.457 line:88%
Tell us what you can do
and how far you’ll go,

6
00:00:17.507 --> 00:00:20.397 line:88%
and we’ll alert you
when help is needed nearby.

7
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:24.370 line:88%
Pick a mission on the map
and sign up in seconds.

8
00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:26.920 line:88%
Organisations launch missions in minutes

9
00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:30.240 line:88%
and see in real time
which tasks are covered.

10
00:00:30.487 --> 00:00:32.687 line:88%
On the day, tap “I’m on my way”

11
00:00:32.737 --> 00:00:35.227 line:88%
and the coordinator knows you’re coming.

12
00:00:35.487 --> 00:00:36.447 line:88%
Your hours are logged

13
00:00:36.497 --> 00:00:38.927 line:88%
and, once the organisation validates them,

14
00:00:38.977 --> 00:00:40.947 line:88%
they count towards your certificate.

15
00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.170 line:88%
Only verified organisations,

16
00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:46.970 line:88%
and your location is shared
only with your mission coordinator.

17
00:00:47.147 --> 00:00:48.437 line:88%
People who help.

18
00:00:48.487 --> 00:00:50.397 line:88%
Organisations that coordinate.

19
00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.500 line:88%
People for People.

20
00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:57.133 line:88%
Your help. Their hope. We connect.
